    "The nulls are READ from the committed grid, not re-run, so this inherits that grid generation. The ceilings are freshly computed here.",
    "The ceiling is the MAX over 5 internal self-control seeds (the falsifier own rule), so it is a conservative floor by construction -- a mean-based floor would be lower and every margin correspondingly more positive.",
    "This bounds the INSTRUMENT. It says nothing about any generator quality, and a mode with no winnable region does not mean the generator is good.",
